[00:00.00] 作词 : Waters
[00:00.00][by:白兔琉璃]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Waters
[00:15.85]The lunatic is on the grass
[00:15.85]疯子走在草地上
[00:23.04]The lunatic is on the grass
[00:23.04]有个疯子走在草地上
[00:30.22]Remembering games and daisy chains and laughs
[00:30.22]为了维护关于游戏 花环 欢笑的回忆
[00:36.69]Got to keep the loonies on the path
[00:36.69]那个疯子走上了这条道路
[00:44.47]The lunatic is in the hall
[00:44.47]那个疯子走到了大厅里
[00:51.82]The lunatics are in my hall
[00:51.82]那个疯子走进了我的脑海中
[00:58.74]The paper holds their folded faces to the floor
[00:58.74]报纸向我们展示了世界的阴暗
[01:05.26]And every day the paper boy brings more
[01:05.26]每一天 报童都把它们准时送来
[01:16.31]And if the dam breaks open many years too soon
[01:16.31]如果水坝在它存在的几年内第一次决堤了
[01:22.99]And if there is no room upon the hill
[01:22.99]而高处没有任何可以避难的地方
[01:30.36]And if your head explodes with dark forbodings too
[01:30.36]如果你被那些阴暗的预测弄得不知所措
[01:36.95]I'll see you on the dark side of the moon
[01:36.95]我会在月之暗面与你会面
[01:48.48]The lunatic is in my head
[01:48.48]那个疯子在我脑海徘徊
[01:55.70]The lunatic is in my head
[01:55.70]那个疯子在我脑海徘徊
[02:02.58]You raise the blade, you make the change
[02:02.58]你举起手术刀 将我重塑
[02:09.45]You re-arrange me 'till I'm sane
[02:09.45]让我重新走上正常的轨道
[02:17.13]You lock the door
[02:17.13]但你却把我锁了起来
[02:19.50]And throw away the key
[02:19.50]让我失去了自由
[02:23.15]There's someone in my head but it's not me.
[02:23.15]只是因为这些疯狂的思想充斥着我的头脑
[02:34.38]And if the cloud bursts, thunder in your ear
[02:34.38]如果云层失控 雷声阵阵时
[02:41.45]You shout and no one seems to hear
[02:41.45]你大声呼喊却无人能听见
[02:48.29]And if the band you're in starts playing different tunes
[02:48.29]如果你所在的乐队开始弹奏些异常的曲子
[02:54.96]I'll see you on the dark side of the moon
[02:54.96]我会在月之暗面与你会面
